    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siiddayntii Yeremyaah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa eraygii Yeremyaah xagga Rabbiga uga yimid markii Nebuusaradaan oo sirkaalkii waardiyayaasha ahaa uu Yeremyaah oo silsilado ku xidhan iyo dadka Yeruusaalem iyo kuwa dalka Yahuudah maxaabiis ahaan Baabuloon ugu kaxaynayay oo uu Yeremyaah Raamaah ku sii daayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sirkaalkii waardiyayaashu Yeremyaah ayuu soo kexeeyey, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Rabbiga Ilaahaaga ah ayaa masiibadan meeshan kaga hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Rabbigu wuu dejiyey, oo wuxuu u sameeyey siduu ku hadlay, maxaa yeelay, Rabbigaad ku dembaabteen, oo codkiisiina ma aydaan addeecin, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaa waxanu idiinku dheceen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bal eeg, maanta silsiladihii gacanta kaaga xidhnaa waan kaa furay. Hadday kula wanaagsan tahay inaad Baabuloon ii raacdid, kaalay oo aniguna si wanaagsan baan kuu dhaqaalayn doonaa, laakiinse hadday kula xun tahay inaad Baabuloon ii raacdid, iska dhaaf. Bal eeg, dalkii oo dhammu adiguu ku hor yaal. Haddaba meel alla meeshii kula wanaagsan ee kula habboon inaad tagtid, tag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba intuusan dib u noqonin ayuu ku yidhi, Waxaad ku noqotaa Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam oo ahaa ina Shaafaan oo boqorkii Baabuloon uu taliye uga dhigay magaalooyinkii dalka Yahuudah, oo isaga la joog dadka dhexdiisa, amase waxaad tagtaa meel alla meeshii kula habboon inaad tagtid. Markaas sirkaalkii waardiyayaashu wuxuu isagii siiyey sahay iyo hadiyad, kolkaasuu iska sii daayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaas Yeremyaah wuxuu Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam ugu tegey Misfaah, oo isaguu la dhex degay dadkii dalka ku hadhay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalyaah Oo La Dilay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo saraakiishii ciidammadii duurka ku jiray oo dhan iyo raggoodiiba markay maqleen in boqorkii Baabuloon uu dalkii taliye uga dhigay Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam, oo uu isagii u dhiibay rag, iyo naago, iyo carruurba, kuwaasoo ahaa masaakiintii dalka ku hadhay oo aan Baabuloon maxaabiis ahaan loogu kaxaysan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayay Gedalyaah ugu yimaadeen Misfaah, waxayna ahaayeen Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah, iyo Yooxaanaan iyo Yoonaataan oo ahaa ilma Qaaree'ax, iyo Seraayaah ina Tanxumed, iyo ilma Ceefay oo ahaa reer Netofaah iyo Yesanyaah oo ahaa wiilkii kii reer Macakaah, iyagii iyo raggoodii oo dhammuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam oo ahaa ina Shaafaan wuxuu dhaar u maray iyagii iyo raggoodiiba, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Ha ka cabsanina inaad reer Kaldayiin u adeegtaan. Haddaba dalka iska degganaada, oo boqorka Baabuloon u adeega, oo idinna waad nabdoonaan doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniguna waxaan degganaan doonaa Misfaah, si aan ugu joogo reer Kaldayiinka hadba noo imanaya, idinkuse waxaad urursataan khamri, iyo midhaha beergoosadka, iyo saliid, oo weelashiinna ku shubta, oo waxaad degganaataan magaalooyinkii aad qabsateen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas oo kalena Yuhuuddii reer Moo'aab, iyo reer Cammoon, iyo reer Edom dhex joogtay oo dhan, iyo kuwii dalalka kale joogay oo dhammuba markay maqleen in boqorkii Baabuloon uu qaar kaga tegey dalkii Yahuudah iyo inuu iyagii madax uga dhigay Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam oo ahaa ina Shaafaan ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayay Yuhuuddii oo dhammu ka soo wada noqdeen meelihii loo kala eryay oo dhan, oo waxay yimaadeen dalkii Yahuudah, oo Gedalyaah bay ugu yimaadeen Misfaah, markaasay soo ururiyeen khamri iyo midhaha beergoosadka oo fara badan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax iyo saraakiishii ciidammadii duurka ku jiray oo dhammuba waxay Gedalyaah ugu yimaadeen Misfaah ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Ma og tahay in Bacaliis oo ah boqorka reer Cammoon uu Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah u soo diray inuu ku dilo? Laakiinse Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam ma uu rumaysan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax si qarsoodi ah Gedalyaah ugula hadlay Misfaah, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Waan ku baryayaaye inaan tago ii fasax, Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah aan soo dilee oo ciduna ma ogaan doonto. Bal muxuu kuu dilayaa oo ay Yuhuuddii kugu soo wada ururtay oo dhammu u kala firdhaan, oo intii dadka dalka Yahuudah ka hadhayna ay u dhintaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam wuxuu Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax ku yidhi, Adigu waxan waa inaadan innaba samayn, waayo, been baad Ismaaciil ka sheegaysaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
